Function composition
A function is comprised of arguments (formals), and code (body).

quadraticRoots = function(a, b, c) {
  x1 = (-b + sqrt((b^2) - (4*a*c))) / (2*a)
  x2 = (-b - sqrt((b^2) - (4*a*c))) / (2*a)
  return(c(x1, x2))
}

